        skos:definition        "Instrument that contains a low frequency hydrophone and is able to either log or stream data in real time. It has a frequency range between 1 Hz - 6.4 kHz (+/- 6 dB bandwidth), and has a variety of depth ratings depending on the housing used."@en;
