        skos:definition        "The VEMCO Minilog II T is a fully submersible, 10-year temperature data logger measures and stores temperature at specified sampling intervals. The Minilog- II-T data logger is manufactured to withstand both fresh and saltwater environments."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
