        skos:definition        "Cylinder-cone net structure. The cylinder is 100 cm diameter  by 107 cm long with a 1.27 cm mesh. The cone has two sections one 107 cm long with 4 mm mesh, and the other 213 cm long with 5.9 meshes per cm or stramin."@en;
