        skos:definition        "A navigation and engineering logging system located within a Autosub Long Range (ALR) autonomous underwater vehicle (AUV). Sensors integrated can include GPS position, pressure transducer, platform altimeter and an internal clock. Data are output as proprietary binary format with .sdb (real time transmitted data) and internally logged high resolution version stored on the vehicle memory."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
