        skos:definition        "Ultra Electronics SSQ906 disposable sonobuoy is an instrument that detects acoustics in the water and transmits a signal to a transmitter which is detected by the vessel and subsequently recorded. The SSQ906 sonobuoy is up to 30 cm long and easily deployed off deck. No further details available at present."@en;
