        skos:definition        "A series comprising two tipping bucket raingauges, the 52202 (heated) and 52203 (unheated). They both have a catchment area of 200 cm2 and a resolution of 0.1 mm per tip. The accuracy is 2 percent up to 25 mm/hour, 3 percent up to 50 mm/hour. This instrument is marketed by Campbell Scientific."@en;
