        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L05/current/156/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L19/current/SDNKG17/>;
        skos:definition        "A single-beam, single-frequency (12 kHz) deep water echosounder, with a maximum power of 2 kW, 160 dB dynamic range and Transducer 12-16-60 (16 degree circular, 60 degree passive beams). It was introduced in June 1989 and replaced by the EA 600 in 2000."@en;
