        skos:altLabel          "CTG Alphatracka II";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L19/current/SDNKG17/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L05/current/124/> , <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L22/current/TOOL0065/>;
        skos:definition        "A compact digitally controlled transmissometer similar to the CTG Alphatracka I but with smaller diameter titanium pressure housing. Versions available with optical path-lengths of 5 or 10 or 25 cm. Standard wavelength is 660 nm but optional wavelengths of 470 nm or 565 nm or 590 nm also available. Depth rated to 6000 m."@en;
