        skos:definition        "The Valeport 740 tide gauge is a strain gauge sensor with a resolution of 1 mm. A user-selectable sampling regime allows up to 2 years' autonomous operation, whilst the optional radio transmission package extends the capabilities for real time operations."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
