        skos:altLabel          "TitraLab TIM90, ABU91/ABU93";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L05/current/LAB12/>;
        skos:definition        "A modular, automated titration system for the laboratory. This includes a TIM90 titration manager, which can manage up to 3 burettes and store 40 methods; and either an ABU 91 Autoburette (one burette), or an ABU 93 Triburette (three burettes), both with 1 ml, 5 ml, 10 ml and 25 ml selectable quantities."@en;
