        skos:definition        "First generation of digital reversing thermometers manufactured by Sensoren Instrumente Systeme (SiS). These include instruments T401, T714 and T746 among others, which were attached to Niskin bottles of a CTD frame during some cruises from the 1990s."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
