        skos:definition        "A family of encapsulated pressure sensors based on Paroscientific patented technology that determines pressure by measuring the oscillating frequency of a quartz crystal resonator. They are available in depth ranges of 10-140m, 10-700m, 0-700m and 1400-7000m with accuracy of 0.01% full scale or 0.02% full scale for miniature sensors."@en;
        skos:inScheme          <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/scheme/SDNDEV/current/>;
