        skos:definition        "An absolute pressure transducer with a Digiquartz pressure sensor and precision thermometer. Operates over a temperature range of 0-50 degC and a pressure range of 0-15000 psia with a typical accuracy of 0.01% and a resolution of 0.0001%."@en;
