        skos:altLabel          "Dionex DX320 IC";
        skos:broader           <http://vocab.nerc.ac.uk/collection/L05/current/LAB45/>;
        skos:definition        "A laboratory instrument for the separation and analysis of ions and polar molecules in aqueous solutions. A typical system consists of an IC-25 ion chromatograph, an autosampler (AS-40 or AS-50), a thermal/chromatography compartment (AS-50), and an eluent/solvent organiser (E01). Configurations can be adapted to suit analytical needs. This system is no longer in production."@en;
