        skos:definition        "A miniature data logger that records temperature and depth at a user programmed time interval. 12-bit version gives a resolution of 0.015 degC and an accuracy of +/-0.1 degC. It is housed in a waterproof cylinder and the temperature sensor is mounted on a protruding stainless steel probe."@en;
